OL,3,GNEWSANeighbouring shops stripped of
OL,4,Alicences over illegal activity
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo neighbouring shops in Liverpool
OL,7,Fhave had their alcohol licences revoked
OL,8,Ffor selling illegal vapes and tobacco
OL,9,Fincluding to children, selling Viagra
OL,10,Fand employing a failed asylum seeker.
OL,12,FL6 Local Store and Park Food Store &
OL,13,FOff Licence, separated by one other
OL,14,Fbusiness on West Derby Road in
OL,15,FTuebrook, had already been hit with
OL,16,Fclosure orders last month.
OL,18,FBoth shops, owned by different people,
OL,19,Fhad ignored warnings to stop by
OL,20,FLiverpool Council's public protection
OL,21,Fteam.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
